  "aiSummary": "This Senate resolution confirms Leslie Cooley Dismukes as Secretary of the Department of Adult Correction, a cabinet-level position requiring Senate approval. The resolution was adopted on June 26, 2025, after being referred to the Judiciary Committee.",
  "aiProArguments": "Supporters argue that confirming a qualified leader for the Department of Adult Correction ensures professional management of North Carolina's prison system and oversight of incarcerated individuals. They contend that the nominee has the necessary experience and qualifications to lead the department effectively and implement the governor's corrections policies.",
  "aiConArguments": "Opponents may raise concerns about the nominee's record, management approach, or vision for the corrections system, though specific objections would depend on the nominee's background. Some may question whether her experience aligns with their priorities regarding prison reform, rehabilitation programs, or accountability measures within the corrections department.",
